1
00:02:05,105 --> 00:02:09,605
所以我们是打算就这么像哑巴一样杵着瞎琢磨 还是...
So are we/just gunna stand afound, thinking about this in silence? Or...!

2
00:02:09,647 --> 00:02:11,605
我知道这地方很奇怪
I know this place is weird.

3
00:02:11,647 --> 00:02:13,230
但说这是童话故事里?
But a fairytale?

4
00:02:13,272 --> 00:02:15,147
这 也太离谱了
I mean that... That's impossible.

5
00:02:15,897 --> 00:02:16,730
咳咳
Ahem.

6
00:02:21,230 --> 00:02:22,980
我们看到了不少难以置信的事
What we've seen is improbable.

7
00:02:23,022 --> 00:02:25,730
但是这不代表我们真的在童话故事里
But that doesn't mean we're in an actual fairytale.

8
00:02:25,772 --> 00:02:28,064
我们真要接受童话这个说法吗?
Are we seriously entertaining this?

9
00:02:28,105 --> 00:02:31,355
你对这情况有更好的解释吗?
Do you have a better explanation for what's going on?

10
00:02:31,397 --> 00:02:34,772
要不 让我们来用逻辑思考一下?
Well, let's try to be more logical, shall we?

11
00:02:34,814 --> 00:02:36,355
我们从天上掉了下来.
We fell from the sky.

12
00:02:36,397 --> 00:02:38,564
Ruby跟一只小老鼠成了朋友...
Ruby made friends with a tiny mouse....

13
00:02:38,605 --> 00:02:39,564
朋友!!!
FRIENDS!!!

14
00:02:39,647 --> 00:02:41,814
Blake和我被杀人藤蔓缠住了...
Blake and got caught by killer vines...

15
00:02:41,855 --> 00:02:48,605
然后 呃... 你的手臂被...被... 被什么东西偷了来着?
And, uhh... You've got your arm stolen by a... by a... What was it that you said?

16
00:02:48,647 --> 00:02:52,022
一只开着装满垃圾的紫色货车还会说话的浣熊
A talking raccoon riding on a purple wagon filled with trash.

17
00:02:54,480 --> 00:02:56,022
阿对 就那个
Yes... That.

18
00:02:57,439 --> 00:02:59,605
行吧 我理解你的想法了
Okay, I see your point of view.

19
00:03:00,230 --> 00:03:02,022
我去那边凉快去了
am going to go over here now-

20
00:03:04,230 --> 00:03:10,022
他当然开着辆紫色的垃圾车...车上说不定还有个小小的方向盘呢...
Of course it was driving a little trash wagon. probaibly has a ltle driving wheel too and..

21
00:03:10,147 --> 00:03:14,064
虽然听起来很疯狂 但是这一切总让我觉得很熟悉
As crazy as it sounds, something about this is familiar.

22
00:03:16,564 --> 00:03:18,189
「坠入仙境世界的女孩」
The Girl Who Fell Through The World'.

23
00:03:21,397 --> 00:03:27,439
我 我想我们是在永恒仙境里
000 think we are in the Everafter

24
00:03:29,147 --> 00:03:31,230
Blake 那个世界是虚构的
Blake, that world is make-believe.

25
00:03:31,272 --> 00:03:34,230
那只是大家小时候都读过的故事中的一部分罢了
It was just part of a story we all read as kids.

26
00:03:34,272 --> 00:03:38,064
那不是虚构的 那是我居住的地方!
It's not make-believe, it's where I live!

27
00:03:38,105 --> 00:03:40,564
你能多跟我们说说这里吗?
Can you tell us more about it?

28
00:03:40,605 --> 00:03:42,564
你听说过爱丽克丝这个名字吗?
Have you ever heard the name Alyx?

29
00:03:42,605 --> 00:03:46,189
一个爱丽克丝 那是一个人生意义吗?
An Alyx... Is that a purpose?

30
00:03:46,564 --> 00:03:51,022
在故事里 爱丽克丝从天而降 并且遇见了猎人鼠
In the story, Alyx fell from the sky and met with the Hunter mice.

31
00:03:51,355 --> 00:03:54,189
被藤蔓缠住 打倒了个伽卜沃克
Got trapped in vines, fought a Jabberwocker..

32
00:03:54,355 --> 00:03:56,314
然后她的刀被偷了 被.
And got her knife stolen by.

33
00:03:56,855 --> 00:03:58,355
被一只会说话的浣熊偷了
talking raccoor

34
00:03:58,397 --> 00:03:59,064
啊啊啊
Agh

35
00:03:59,230 --> 00:04:02,939
对 然后她在一场游戏中赢了红国王
and then she beat the Red King at a board

36
00:04:02,980 --> 00:04:09,564
她还遇到了好奇猫 锈迹骑士 最终离开了仙境 通过..
Met the, Curious Cat, the Rusted Knight, and finally got out throught

37
00:04:10,522 --> 00:04:11,980
通过树离开
The tree.

38
00:04:13,647 --> 00:04:14,522
那现在怎么办?
So what now?

39
00:04:14,564 --> 00:04:15,939
我们要去树那边吗?
Do we go to the tree?

40
00:04:15,980 --> 00:04:17,147
去找爱丽克丝?
Look for Alyx?

41
00:04:17,189 --> 00:04:18,147
Yang的手臂?
Yang's arm?

42
00:04:18,189 --> 00:04:20,814
Ruby 你也还没找回新月玫瑰
Ruby, you're still missing Crescent Rose.

43
00:04:20,855 --> 00:04:23,105
我敢打赌一定在不吉游商手里
I'll bet the Jinxy Peddler has it.

44
00:04:23,397 --> 00:04:24,064
谁!?
Who!?

45
00:04:25,480 --> 00:04:27,564
不吉游商?
The Jinxy Peddler?

46
00:04:27,939 --> 00:04:30,439
我只知道这么一只会说话的浣熊
That's the only talking raccoon I know.

47
00:04:30,480 --> 00:04:34,355
我是真不敢相信这个傻X世界 还有那颗傻X的树
I cantt believe this stupid world... And the stupid tree..

48
00:04:30,939 --> 00:04:33,147
你知道他可能会在哪吗?
Do you know where he might be?

49
00:04:33,689 --> 00:04:35,230
当然!
Of course!

50
00:04:35,272 --> 00:04:38,980
让我来带路吧! 带你们去…
I'll lead the way! Right to...

51
00:04:42,689 --> 00:04:45,105
所以 小镇就在前面了对吗?
So, the town is just ahead, right?

52
00:04:49,939 --> 00:04:51,064
我一直在想
I've been thinking.

53
00:04:51,105 --> 00:04:54,355
如果我们要去这座小镇 我们一定要小心
If we're going to go to this town, we need to be careful.

54
00:04:54,772 --> 00:04:58,897
爱丽克丝不了解他们的习俗 因此还在镇民中搅起了战争
Alyx didn't know their customs and ended up starting a war among the townsfolk.

55
00:04:59,314 --> 00:05:01,564
麻烦从那之后就一直找上她 不管她在哪
Trouble followed her everywhere she went.

56
00:05:02,814 --> 00:05:06,064
确实是这样 但是 她是个卑劣的人 不是吗?
Well, yeah, but, she was kind of a mean person, right?

57
00:05:06,605 --> 00:05:09,230
在整个故事里她都是靠着谎言和欺骗前进的
She lied and cheated her way through most of the book.

58
00:05:09,272 --> 00:05:11,064
她只是为了生存
She was trying to survive.

59
00:05:11,439 --> 00:05:14,355
这些老故事讲的道理都太单纯了
The morals of those old stories are so simplistic.

60
00:05:14,397 --> 00:05:17,564
无论如何 我们需要格外小心
Either way, we need to tread lightly.

61
00:05:21,647 --> 00:05:24,605
嗯嗯 小镇就在前面了
Mmm, the town's just up ahead.

62
00:05:24,647 --> 00:05:28,814
不吉游商每次去小镇之前都会在我们的村子里停留一会
The Jinxy Peddler always stops by our village before he goes to town.

63
00:05:28,855 --> 00:05:31,397
他也从你们那偷东西吗?
Do they steal stuff from you guys too?

64
00:05:31,605 --> 00:05:32,855
偷东西?
Steal?

65
00:05:33,064 --> 00:05:34,397
从来不会!
Never!

66
00:05:34,730 --> 00:05:37,022
他只会拿走我们没有在看着的东西
They just take the things we're not looking at.

67
00:05:37,230 --> 00:05:38,480
公平 公平
Fairness fair.

68
00:05:40,314 --> 00:05:42,397
听起来可真是个诚信商人
Sounds like a legitimate business person.

69
00:05:43,189 --> 00:05:46,230
他到底怎么把你手臂偷走的?
How did they manage to steal your arm anyway?

70
00:05:46,272 --> 00:05:48,230
我掉下来后昏迷了
I was knocked out from the fall.

71
00:05:48,605 --> 00:05:52,647
等我苏醒过来 那只狡诈的浣熊已经拿着我的手臂跑了 我都来不及阻止
When I came to, that sneaky raccoon had already grabbed my arm and ran off before I could stop him.

72
00:05:52,689 --> 00:05:54,230
哈哈哈哈哈哈
Hahahahaha!

73
00:05:54,772 --> 00:05:57,480
所以你说 她是不是趁你‘手无寸铁’时对你下手的?
So would you say he caught you 'unarmed?

74
00:05:59,022 --> 00:06:00,314
多么高明的‘缴械手段’啊
How 'disarming'.

75
00:06:01,897 --> 00:06:03,064
也是时候了
About time.

76
00:06:04,605 --> 00:06:06,022
是什么时候?
For what?

77
00:06:06,939 --> 00:06:07,897
没什么
Nothing.

78
00:06:09,397 --> 00:06:14,022
别担心 我们会找到离开这里的方法 然后我们会回家的
Don't worry, we'll find a way out of here and then we'll go back home.

79
00:06:18,355 --> 00:06:19,647
Weiss?
Weiss?

80
00:06:21,064 --> 00:06:24,939
全都 全都没了
It's... it's all gone.

81
00:06:25,314 --> 00:06:27,814
已经没有我能回去的地方了
There's nothing left for me to go back to.

82
00:06:29,022 --> 00:06:30,814
就像信标一样
Just like Beacon.

83
00:06:32,980 --> 00:06:36,439
你已经为擎天尽力了 Weiss
You did the best you could for Atlas, Weiss.

84
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:38,147
但那还不够
But it wasn't enough.

85
00:06:39,272 --> 00:06:42,105
我们做了个疯狂的计划 将整个王国置于危险中
We hashed a crazy plan that put a whole kingdom at risk.

86
00:06:42,147 --> 00:06:44,605
我们甚至不知道圣遗物有没有保住
And we don't even know if we saved the Relics from...

87
00:06:48,105 --> 00:06:52,272
或许Jaune和温特有把人们救出去
Maybe Jaune and Winter were able to get them out.

88
00:06:52,564 --> 00:06:54,647
尽管发生了那些事
Despite everything.

89
00:06:56,397 --> 00:06:58,272
尽管我们.
Despite us...

90
00:07:03,939 --> 00:07:07,189
我 我知道Penny...
I... I know that Penny...

91
00:07:08,272 --> 00:07:10,272
我知道那件事很难消化
I know that was a lot to hear.

92
00:07:33,189 --> 00:07:36,855
所以这里就是入口了你说那边叫另一亩地?
So this is the entrance to the other. Acre, you called it?

93
00:07:38,855 --> 00:07:42,480
是的! 我们只需要走过这座桥 然后我们就会去到
Yup! All we do is cross the bridge and we'll be...

94
00:07:43,147 --> 00:07:46,147
去到对面不知道是什么的那个地方
Well, wherever over there is.

95
00:07:47,064 --> 00:07:48,189
你不知道?
You don't know?

96
00:07:48,439 --> 00:07:51,064
不知道 我从来没有离家这么远
Nope. Never been this far from home.

97
00:07:52,272 --> 00:07:55,439
哦 呃 那你要不要回去?
Oh, uh... Maybe you should go back?

98
00:07:55,480 --> 00:07:58,022
我根本不知道怎么回去
I wouldn't have any idea how to go back.

99
00:07:58,064 --> 00:08:00,064
或许我可以在这桥边生活
Maybe I'll live by this bridge.

100
00:08:04,522 --> 00:08:05,814
我来解决吧
I'll handle this.

101
00:08:05,855 --> 00:08:11,564
建一座房子 我第一座房子 要在这里找到我的意义 在我最棒的房子!
Building a house, My ve~ry firt house. Gotia find hy purposelin my -- BEST HOUSE!

102
00:08:11,605 --> 00:08:13,564
你要不要跟我们一起走?
Would you like to come with us?

103
00:08:18,939 --> 00:08:21,980
是啊 那可能是最好的选择了
Yeah, that's probably for the best.

104
00:08:34,647 --> 00:08:38,397
各位 表现得像常人一样就好
Just act like you belong, everybody.

105
00:08:38,814 --> 00:08:41,022
我一直想变成长人
I've always wanted to be long.

106
00:08:41,355 --> 00:08:42,689
但我现在还是短短的
But I'm still just small.

107
00:08:47,730 --> 00:08:48,647
就是那里!
There it is!

108
00:08:49,064 --> 00:08:50,272
我们的战术是什么?
Sowhat's the strategy?

109
00:08:50,730 --> 00:08:52,272
直接过去揍他还是怎样?
Just start ruffin' him up or what?

110
00:08:57,189 --> 00:09:00,814
在书里 爱丽克丝跟不吉游商做了交易才拿回她的刀
In the book, Alyx had to barter with Jinxy for her dagger.

111
00:09:00,980 --> 00:09:03,647
是啊 我还是宁愿直接捶他
Yeah, I think I'd rather hit him.

112
00:09:08,980 --> 00:09:11,564
欢迎! 你们每一位!
Welcome! One and all!

113
00:09:11,605 --> 00:09:13,439
他好可爱!
He's adorable!

114
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:16,314
而且比书里看着年长了不少
And a lot older than I remember from the book.

115
00:09:16,355 --> 00:09:18,564
我是不吉游商
I am Jinxy.

116
00:09:18,605 --> 00:09:23,230
这些 是一亩地最棒的宝物
And these, are the finest treasures of the Acre.

117
00:09:27,647 --> 00:09:29,730
我没看到我的手臂
don't see my arm

118
00:09:29,772 --> 00:09:33,980
不吉游商的所有宝物都是将其他东西赋予了虚假的表象
All of Jinxy's treasures arejust other items in disguise.

119
00:09:34,022 --> 00:09:37,272
这样大家就会以为自己买到非常贵重的东西了
So that people think they are buying something extremely valuable

120
00:09:37,939 --> 00:09:38,272
好吧?
Okay?

121
00:09:39,314 --> 00:09:42,314
那到底哪一个是Yang的手臂?
So, which one is Yang's arm?

122
00:09:43,814 --> 00:09:46,022
你的心是怎么指引你的?
What does your heart tell you?

123
00:09:46,689 --> 00:09:48,230
爱丽克丝就是靠遵从内心知道的
That's how Alyx knew

124
00:09:48,772 --> 00:09:53,605
怎么说呐 那一根看起来差不多是手臂的大小 吧
I mean, that one looks roughly arm-sized... ish...

125
00:09:56,022 --> 00:09:56,855
Ruby?
Ruby?

126
00:09:57,439 --> 00:10:01,147
我总觉得那边那个有些不同
There's something about that one.

127
00:10:04,147 --> 00:10:05,772
第一件
First item.

128
00:10:07,230 --> 00:10:09,730
覆满钻石的兔子雕塑
The diamond-studded rabbit!

129
00:10:10,147 --> 00:10:11,522
你!
You!

130
00:10:12,397 --> 00:10:13,522
不吉哟
Jinxies.

131
00:10:15,314 --> 00:10:17,272
我们没钱要怎么竞拍?
How are we going to bid without any money?

132
00:10:17,314 --> 00:10:19,939
永恒仙境里应该是没有金钱的
I don't think there's any money in The Everafter

133
00:10:20,022 --> 00:10:22,480
不吉游商会直接说他想要的报酬
Jinxy just names whatever price he wants.

134
00:10:22,522 --> 00:10:24,605
他从爱丽克丝那要了什么
What did Jinxy want from Alyx.

135
00:10:24,647 --> 00:10:28,105
她最难过的回忆 以及最开心的回忆
Her saddest memory... and her happiest.

136
00:10:28,147 --> 00:10:31,189
成交价 一个拥抱
Sold for - A hug.

137
00:10:32,897 --> 00:10:35,397
拥抱可贵重了!
Hugs are very valuable!

138
00:10:35,897 --> 00:10:37,397
看来这次或许不会太麻烦
Maybe this won't be so bad after all.

139
00:10:37,439 --> 00:10:41,855
第二件物品 黄金权杖
Second item, a golden septre.

140
00:10:44,814 --> 00:10:46,230
竞拍底价为
The bidding starts at -

141
00:10:46,272 --> 00:10:48,064
不对 我是第一个举手的
No, I was the first one to...

142
00:10:48,105 --> 00:10:51,522
知道被爱是什么感觉
Knowing what it is to feel loved

143
00:10:53,022 --> 00:10:56,230
对于某些人来说 是个好价
A fair price for some, I'd say.

144
00:11:00,564 --> 00:11:04,355
知道被爱的感觉 以皇家诏令
Knowing what it's like to feel loved, by royal decree.

145
00:11:04,480 --> 00:11:05,480
成交!
Sold!

146
00:11:05,522 --> 00:11:07,730
等等 那是我的手臂!
Wait, that's my arm!

147
00:11:07,772 --> 00:11:10,480
管它是什么 现在归皇家所属了
Whatever it is, it's royal property now.

148
00:11:10,522 --> 00:11:13,939
为了国王陛下的生日 什么都不算贵
No price is too high for his majesty's birthday.

149
00:11:13,980 --> 00:11:16,480
最后一件物品玉人偶
Last item, the jade marionette.

150
00:11:16,522 --> 00:11:18,105
我们尝试过你的提议了Blake
We tried it your way, Blake.

151
00:11:18,230 --> 00:11:19,147
你!
You!

152
00:11:20,022 --> 00:11:22,147
Ruby 你在做什么!
Ruby, what are you doing!

153
00:11:22,272 --> 00:11:27,897
现在价格是 足够填满这个罐子的希望
Bidding starts at — enough hope to fill this jar.

154
00:11:33,939 --> 00:11:35,939
你没有足够的希望 对吧?
You don't have enough, do you?

155
00:11:41,272 --> 00:11:43,647
你这个. 啊啊啊啊啊!
Why, you little... raghh!

156
00:11:44,897 --> 00:11:46,022
不要碰它!
Leave that alone!

157
00:11:46,064 --> 00:11:48,439
在竞拍结束前你不该碰它!
You can't touch it until the deal is done!

158
00:11:52,855 --> 00:11:53,689
哈?
Huh?

159
00:11:57,522 --> 00:11:58,605
是假货!
It's a fake!

160
00:12:00,939 --> 00:12:01,689
嘘!
Boo!

161
00:12:03,814 --> 00:12:04,647
啊啊啊!
Ahhh!

162
00:12:05,730 --> 00:12:06,730
我要去拿手臂!
I'm going for it!

163
00:12:16,355 --> 00:12:17,522
拿到这个了
There's that.

164
00:12:25,939 --> 00:12:26,814
我抢到了!
I got it!

165
00:12:27,647 --> 00:12:28,772
Ruby快走!
Ruby come on!

166
00:12:35,355 --> 00:12:36,772
咳咳!
Ahem!

167
00:12:45,272 --> 00:12:49,772
那些人竞拍得太认真了
Those people take auctions very seriously.

168
00:12:50,272 --> 00:12:50,772
击掌?
High five?

169
00:12:50,814 --> 00:12:51,980
呃啊!
Ugh!

170
00:12:54,730 --> 00:12:56,689
我们跟爱丽克丝做了一样的事情!
We're doing the same thing Alyx did!

171
00:12:56,980 --> 00:12:59,147
我们毀了一切!
We're ruining everything!

172
00:12:59,480 --> 00:13:01,939
你现在最担心的居然是这个?
That's your biggest concern right now?

173
